  "question": {
    "text": "A carrier wave of amplitude <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;is modulated by a sinusoidal base band signal of amplitude <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>. The ratio of maximum amplitude to minimum amplitude in an amplitude modulated wave is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "GECCQ",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "wOLAh",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "q6kq2",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "w4Qbn",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The given data is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p>Thus, the maximum amplitude and minimum amplitude is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></math></p><p>Hence, the ratio is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>min</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>18</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p></blockquote>",
